0, "y": 200, "width": 250, "height": 80, "text": "Jede Position hat einen\neigenen Wertevorrat:\n2 in Spalte 2 heißt immer\nKastenverbinder.", "originalText": "Jede Position hat einen\neigenen Wertevorrat:\n2 in Spalte 2 heißt immer\nKastenverbinder.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.25, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100}, {"type": "text", "id": "an2", "x": 800, "y": 256, "width": 180, "height": 60, "text": "0 = nicht belegt,\nz. B. ein Kasten\nhat keine Bauart.", "originalText": "0 = nicht belegt,\nz. B. ein Kasten\nhat keine Bauart.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.25, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "ev", "x": 40, "y": 490, "width": 700, "height": 115, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "ev_t", "x": 64, "y": 513, "width": 600, "height": 68, "text": "Typ 11 = [1, 1, 1] = Niederspannung.Leitung.Kabel\nMuster [*, 2, *]   = jeder Kastenverbinder, jede Ebene\nMuster [1, *, *]   = Niederspannung und alles darunter", "originalText": "Typ 11 = [1, 1, 1] = Niederspannung.Leitung.Kabel\nMuster [*, 2, *]   = jeder Kastenverbinder, jede Ebene\nMuster [1, *, *]   = Niederspannung und alles darunter", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.25, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100}]}